<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Game Ular Tangga Informatika Kelas 7 - Perangkat Lunak</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Canvas Confetti for Victory -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
    <!-- Custom CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body class="text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between p-2 md:p-6">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full bg-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-4 mb-4 shadow-xl">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-center md:text-left">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="p-3 bg-indigo-600 rounded-xl text-white shadow-lg">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad text-3xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 via-purple-300 to-pink-400">
                        Game Ular Tangga Informatika 7
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-300 font-medium">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark text-indigo-400 mr-1"></i> Materi: Perangkat Lunak (Software)
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-900/60 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/80 text-right">
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Guru Pengampu:</p>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-indigo-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie mr-1"></i> Tuti Zahara Putri, S.Pd.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center">

        <!-- STEP 1: LOGIN FORM / PLAYER IDENTITY -->
        <div id="login-screen" class="bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 max-w-md mx-auto w-full shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-lg">
            <div class="text-center mb-6">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 shadow-lg">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-astronaut text-3xl text-white"></i>
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Identitas Siswa</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Masukkan data diri untuk memulai permainan</p>
            </div>

            <form id="identity-form" onsubmit="startGame(event)" class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Nama Siswa</label>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <span class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3 flex items-center text-slate-400">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i>
                        </span>
                        <input type="text" id="student-name" required placeholder="Masukkan Nama Lengkap"
                            class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-3 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-600 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 text-white placeholder-slate-500 text-sm transition">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Kelas</label>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <span class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3 flex items-center text-slate-400">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i>
                        </span>
                        <input type="text" id="student-class" required placeholder="Contoh: 7-A / 7-B"
                            class="w-full pl-10 pr-4 py-3 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-600 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 text-white placeholder-slate-500 text-sm transition">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" 
                    class="w-full py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-purple-600 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-purple-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-indigo-500/30 transition duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mt-4">
                    <span>Mulai Permainan</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 2: GAME AREA -->
        <div id="game-screen" class="hidden grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start">
            
            <!-- Left Side: Board (7 cols) -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="relative w-full max-w-[550px] bg-slate-900 p-2 rounded-2xl border-2 border-indigo-500/50 shadow-2xl">
                    <!-- Board Canvas Overlay for Snakes & Ladders SVG -->
                    <svg id="board-svg" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-10 p-2"></svg>
                    
                    <!-- Grid Board -->
                    <div id="board" class="board-grid rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative"></div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Legend / Petunjuk Warna -->
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mt-3 text-xs text-slate-300 bg-slate-800/80 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 inline-block"></span> Tangga (Naik)</span>
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-400 inline-block"></span> Ular (Turun)</span>
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-300 inline-block"></span> Petak Kuis</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Side: Control & Score Dashboard (5 cols) -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
                
                <!-- Dashboard Siswa & Skor -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-md">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-700 pb-3 mb-4">
                        <div>
                            <h3 id="display-name" class="font-bold text-lg text-white">Nama Siswa</h3>
                            <p id="display-class" class="text-xs text-indigo-400 font-semibold">Kelas 7-X</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-right">
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">Total Skor</span>
                            <span id="display-score" class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-400">0</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center text-xs">
                        <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
                            <span class="text-slate-400 block">Posisi</span>
                            <span id="display-pos" class="font-bold text-indigo-300 text-base">Petak 1</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
                            <span class="text-slate-400 block">Benar</span>
                            <span id="display-correct" class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-base">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
                            <span class="text-slate-400 block">Salah</span>
                            <span id="display-wrong" class="font-bold text-rose-400 text-base">0</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Dice Controller -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/90 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium mb-4">Kocok dadu untuk memindahkan bidak</p>
                    
                    <!-- 3D Animated Dice Box -->
                    <div class="h-24 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <div id="dice" class="dice">
                            <!-- Face 1 -->
                            <div class="dice-side front"><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 2/2"></div></div>
                            <!-- Face 2 -->
                            <div class="dice-side back"><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 1/1"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 3/3"></div></div>
                            <!-- Face 3 -->
                            <div class="dice-side right"><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 1/1"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 2/2"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 3/3"></div></div>
                            <!-- Face 4 -->
                            <div class="dice-side left"><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 1/1"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 1/3"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 3/1"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 3/3"></div></div>
                            <!-- Face 5 -->
                            <div class="dice-side top"><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 1/1"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 1/3"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 2/2"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 3/1"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 3/3"></div></div>
                            <!-- Face 6 -->
                            <div class="dice-side bottom"><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 1/1"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 1/3"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 2/1"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 2/3"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 3/1"></div><div class="dot" style="grid-area: 3/3"></div></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <button id="roll-btn" onclick="rollDice()" 
                        class="pulse-button px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-600 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-orange-500 text-slate-950 font-extrabold rounded-xl shadow-lg transition duration-200 text-base flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-dice text-xl"></i> Lempar Dadu
                    </button>
                    
                    <p id="game-status-text" class="text-xs text-indigo-300 mt-4 min-h-[18px]">Siap melemparkan dadu...</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- QUIZ MODAL -->
    <div id="quiz-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 shadow-2xl relative transform transition-all scale-100">
            <div id="quiz-header-tag" class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-500/30 mb-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question mr-1"></i> Pertanyaan Kuis
            </div>
            
            <h3 id="quiz-question" class="text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4 leading-snug">
                Soal kuis akan muncul di sini?
            </h3>

            <div id="quiz-options" class="space-y-2.5 mb-5">
                <!-- Options injected via JS -->
            </div>

            <!-- Quiz Feedback Message -->
            <div id="quiz-feedback" class="hidden p-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold mb-4 text-center"></div>

            <button id="quiz-submit-btn" onclick="submitAnswer()" disabled
                class="w-full py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:hover:bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transition">
                Jawab Pertanyaan
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VICTORY / RESULT CERTIFICATE MODAL -->
    <div id="victory-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-lg z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border-2 border-amber-500/50 rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full p-6 md:p-8 shadow-2xl relative my-auto">
            
            <!-- Certificate Content (Printable) -->
            <div id="printable-certificate" class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 to-slate-900 border-4 border-double border-amber-400/60 p-6 rounded-xl text-center relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -right-12 -top-12 w-32 h-32 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
                
                <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-5xl text-amber-400 mb-3 drop-shadow-md"></i>
                <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-300 via-amber-400 to-amber-200 uppercase tracking-wide">
                    Sertifikat Kelulusan Game
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1 mb-4">Kuis Informatika Kelas 7 - Perangkat Lunak</p>
                
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 italic">Diberikan kepada siswa:</p>
                <h3 id="cert-name" class="text-xl font-bold text-white my-1 underline decoration-amber-400 decoration-2">Nama Siswa</h3>
                <p id="cert-class" class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-300">Kelas 7-X</p>
                
                <div class="my-6 py-4 bg-slate-950/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/80 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block uppercase">Total Skor</span>
                        <span id="cert-score" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-400">100</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block uppercase">Jawaban Benar</span>
                        <span id="cert-correct" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-400">0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block uppercase">Jawaban Salah</span>
                        <span id="cert-wrong" class="text-2xl font-black text-rose-400">0</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    Selamat! Kamu telah berhasil menyelesaikan seluruh tantangan papan Ular Tangga dan menguasai materi <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">Perangkat Lunak (Software)</span> dengan sangat baik.
                </p>

                <div class="flex justify-between items-end border-t border-slate-700 pt-4 text-left">
                    <div class="text-xs">
                        <p class="text-slate-400">Tanggal: <span id="cert-date" class="text-slate-200">01/01/2025</span></p>
                        <p class="text-slate-400">Status: <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">LULUS</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-right">
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Guru Pengampu:</p>
                        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-indigo-300 mt-1">Tuti Zahara Putri, S.Pd.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Modal Action Buttons -->
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mt-6">
                <button onclick="window.print()" class="flex-1 py-3 bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-print"></i> Cetak / Simpan Hasil
                </button>
                <button onclick="restartGame()" class="flex-1 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-purple-600 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-purple-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right"></i> Main Lagi
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full text-center py-4 text-xs text-slate-500 border-t border-slate-800 mt-6">
        &copy; Game Ular Tangga Kuis Informatika Kelas 7 &bull; Pengampu: Tuti Zahara Putri, S.Pd.
    </footer>

    <!-- Custom JS Script -->
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
